38
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:32,240
Then she said: 'Fine, but his phone is full of my photos.' Fine —

39
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:34,520
'and the gifts he gave you, will you take or

40
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:37,160
